2026-09-10 10:29:53.791 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR] Versionshinweise:
2026-09-10 10:29:53.821 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   1. Heap overflow vulnerability is fixed in RAR5 recovery volume
2026-09-10 10:29:53.848 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        data reconstruction code. It affects WinRAR, RAR and UnRAR.
2026-09-10 10:29:53.881 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        UnRAR.dll library doesn't include recovery volume processing,
2026-09-10 10:29:53.903 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        so it is not affected.
2026-09-10 10:29:53.933 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:29:53.960 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        We are thankful to Arjun Basnet from Securin Labs for letting us know
2026-09-10 10:29:53.985 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        about this security issue.
2026-09-10 10:29:54.015 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:29:54.050 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]     2. Symbolic link pointing outside of destination folder could be created
2026-09-10 10:29:54.085 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        even without -ola switch, when extracting a specially crafted
2026-09-10 10:29:54.123 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        RAR archive by WinRAR, RAR, UnRAR or UnRAR.dll library.
2026-09-10 10:29:54.157 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:29:54.194 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        Further check in extraction code prevents placing files to such folder
2026-09-10 10:29:54.228 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        even in case of multiple extraction commands, excluding the possibility
2026-09-10 10:29:54.264 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        of path traversal attack for WinRAR, RAR or UnRAR based extraction.
2026-09-10 10:29:54.300 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        It limits the potential threat to a case where another tool uses this
2026-09-10 10:29:54.334 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        symbolic link to store files.
2026-09-10 10:29:54.365 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:29:54.407 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        We are thankful to scofaild23-bnomran for letting us know about this
2026-09-10 10:29:54.444 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        security issue.
2026-09-10 10:29:54.480 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:29:54.514 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]     3. 7zxa.dll 7z extraction library is updated to version 26.02 to include
2026-09-10 10:29:54.551 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        bug and vulnerability fixes by the library developer.
2026-09-10 10:29:54.590 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:29:54.628 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]     4. Switch -iver prints RAR version even if -idc is specified
2026-09-10 10:29:54.672 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        in the command line, configuration file or RARINISWITCHES environment
2026-09-10 10:29:54.687 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        variable. Previously -idc blocked -iver action.
