2026-09-10 10:29:57.543 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   What's changed
2026-09-10 10:29:57.578 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - Fastboot:
2026-09-10 10:29:57.613 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Enumerate storage devices
2026-09-10 10:29:57.650 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Add mount, unmount, and custom gadget support
2026-09-10 10:29:57.688 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Rename stage to download
2026-09-10 10:29:57.726 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Retry on transient USB errors
2026-09-10 10:29:57.765 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - OS Customisation:
2026-09-10 10:29:57.803 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Don't set any groups, leave it to the OS
2026-09-10 10:29:57.845 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Use explicit runcmds for passwordless sudo
2026-09-10 10:29:57.889 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Require active locale selection; no pre-filled defaults
2026-09-10 10:29:57.909 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - UI:
2026-09-10 10:29:57.942 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Refresh clipboard status as text fields show
2026-09-10 10:29:57.973 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - SSH:
2026-09-10 10:29:58.003 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Add state machine for handling PuTTY's multiline SSH keys
2026-09-10 10:29:58.027 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - Linux:
2026-09-10 10:29:58.060 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Explicitly exclude libsystemd
2026-09-10 10:29:58.099 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - Write Operations:
2026-09-10 10:29:58.137 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Increase watchdog stall timeout to 180s to match the async write timeout
2026-09-10 10:29:58.174 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Exclude final data sync from write watchdog to avoid false stalls on slow
2026-09-10 10:29:58.217 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]       cards
2026-09-10 10:29:58.255 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - i18n: Updated French, Slovak translation dictionaries
